    </tr>
  </table>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div class="center" style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <span style="font-size: 14pt;">Guide to the</span>
    <span style="font-size: 14pt;">Awards and Certificate Collection</span><br>
    <span style="font-size: 14pt;">1775-2006 (bulk 1893-1994)</span>
  </div>
  <div class="center" style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <span style="font-size: 12pt;">UPP 500</span>
  </div>
  <div class="center" style="margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <span style="font-size: 12pt;">4.0 Cubic feet</span>
    <span style="font-size: 12pt;">Prepared by <span data-field="prepared_by_name">{{ prepared_by_name }}</span></span><br>
    <span data-field="prepared_date">{{ prepared_date }}</span>
  </div>
  <div class="center" style="margin-top: 50px;">
    Access is granted in accordance with the <span data-field="protocols_link">{{ protocols_link }}</span>.
  </div>

  <div class="divider" style="margin: 50px 0;"></div>

  <div class="center" style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <span style="font-weight: bold;">PROVENANCE</span>
  </div>
  <div class="left" style="margin-left: 100px;">
    The Awards and Certificate Collection consists of various honors bestowed upon the University of Pennsylvania and individuals connected to the University over its history that were transferred to the University Archives separate from any larger collection.
  </div>

  <div class="divider" style="margin: 50px 0;"></div>

  <div class="center" style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <span style="font-weight: bold;">ARRANGEMENT</span>
  </div>
  <div class="left" style="margin-left: 100px;">
    The Awards and Certificates Collection is organized into three series: Individual, University, and Other. All three series are arranged alphabetically.
  </div>

  <div class="divider" style="margin: 50px 0;"></div>

  <div class="center" style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <span style="font-weight: bold;">SCOPE AND CONTENT NOTE</span>
  </div>
  <div class="left" style="margin-left: 100px;">
    The Awards and Certificates Collection is comprised of various honors bestowed upon the University of Pennsylvania as well as organizations and individuals associated with the University. Those awarded specifically to individuals (whether by the University or outside organizations) can be found in the Individual series. Those awarded directly to the University comprise the University series.
  </div>

  <div class="divider" style="margin: 50px 0;"></div>

  <div class="center" style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <span style="font-weight: bold;">OTHER</span>
  </div>
  <div class="left" style="margin-left: 100px;">
    The Other series consists of awards and certificates (usually proclamations) that were given to the University but have no direct relation to its activities or history.
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
